<title>USA: TCI acquisition of DMX advances.</title>
<headline>TCI acquisition of DMX advances.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>DMX Inc said Wednesday its board had approved the acquisition of the company by TCI Music Inc, a unit of cable television giant Tele-Communications Inc.</p>
</text>
